1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,480
Bakit tumidikit ang magnet sa ref mo?

2
00:00:02,980 --> 00:00:06,620
The answer is an invisible force you cannot see.

3
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:12,040
Inside a magnet, tiny regions called domains act like miniature magnets.

4
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:16,880
Sa ordinaryong bakal, nakakalat sila at nagkakansilahan ang lakas nila,

5
00:00:17,040 --> 00:00:20,000
pero sa magnet, halos lahat ay nakahanay.

6
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:23,360
Ang lakas na iyan ay umaabot bilang magnetic field,

7
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:27,240
na sinusunda ng iron filings sa mga kurba sa pagitan ng dalawang pole.

8
00:00:28,040 --> 00:00:36,340
Opposite poles attract, like poles repel, at kahit hatiin mo ang magnet, bawat piraso ay may north at south pa rin.

9
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:41,280
Ang earth ay isang giganting magnet at ang field nito ang sinusunda ng compass,

10
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:45,420
at ang current sa isang coil ay lumilikhan ng electromagnet.

11
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:47,480
Kaya ito ang tanong ko sa inyo.

12
00:00:47,660 --> 00:00:53,680
Kung makakagawa ka ng pinakamalakas na magnet sa mundo, ano ang una mong bubuhatin gamit ito?

13
00:00:53,820 --> 00:00:54,620
Ikoment mo sa baba!

14
00:00:55,380 --> 00:00:56,780
Follow me for more Tech Explained.

15
00:00:56,780 --> 00:00:57,340
See ya!
